  "notes": "{暮|く}らす is an intransitive godan verb meaning to live (lifestyle) or make a living.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧ (intransitive)\n- No transitive pair\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- 〜⟦で→で：00502_de⟧{暮|く}らす: to live in (place)\n- 〜⟦と→と：00512_to⟧{暮|く}らす: to live with (person)\n- 〜⟦で→で：00502_de⟧{暮|く}らす: to live on (income)\n- ⟦{幸|しあわ}せ→幸せ：01420_shiawase⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{暮|く}らす: to live happily\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {暮|く}らす: lifestyle, how one spends daily life\n- ⟦{住|す}む→住む：00673_sumu⟧: residence, where one lives (location-focused)\n- ⟦{生|い}きる→生きる：01184_ikiru⟧: to be alive, to live (existence)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {暮|く}らし: life, living, livelihood\n- ⟦{一人暮|ひとりぐ}らし→一人暮らし：03142_hitorigurashi⟧: living alone\n- ⟦{日暮|ひぐ}らし→日暮らし：noentry⟧: daily life; day-to-day living\n\nThe ている form {暮|く}らしている describes an ongoing living situation.",
